{"strongs": "H0200", "word": "אִוֶּ֫לֶת", "translit": "iv.ve.let", "root": "אול", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "folly.", "definition": "אִוֶּ֫לֶת 25 noun feminine folly. — absolute Prov 12:23 +; construct Prov 14:8 +; suffix אִוַּלְתִּי Ps 38:6 , etc.; — folly , special product of כְּסִילִים (see כֶּסֶל ) Prov 12:23 + (12 t.); with פְּתָאִים Prov 14:18 with אֱוִלִיים only Prov 16:22 ; Prov 27:22 for alliteration. It is bound up in mind of boy, to be removed only by rod of discipline Prov 22:15 ׳ א personified tears down house built by חַכְמוֺת נָשִׁים Prov 14:1 it is contrasted with תְּבוּנָה Prov 14:29 ; Prov 15:21 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB195')\">BDB195</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H200')\">H200</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB194')\">BDB194</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB196')\">BDB196</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אִוֶּ֫לֶת</bdbheb><sub>25</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>folly.</highlightword> — absolute <ref ref=\"Prov 12:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,23)\">Prov 12:23</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Prov 14:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,8)\">Prov 14:8</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אִוַּלְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 38:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,6)\">Ps 38:6</ref>, etc.; — <highlight>folly</highlight>, special product of <bdbheb>כְּסִילִים</bdbheb> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>כֶּסֶל</reflink></bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Prov 12:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,23)\">Prov 12:23</ref> + (12 t.); with <bdbheb>פְּתָאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,18)\">Prov 14:18</ref> with <bdbheb>אֱוִלִיים</bdbheb> only <ref ref=\"Prov 16:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,22)\">Prov 16:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 27:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,22)\">Prov 27:22</ref> for alliteration. It is bound up in mind of boy, to be removed only by rod of discipline <ref ref=\"Prov 22:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,15)\">Prov 22:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> personified tears down house built by <bdbheb>חַכְמוֺת נָשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,1)\">Prov 14:1</ref> it is contrasted with <bdbheb>תְּבוּנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,29)\">Prov 14:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 15:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,21)\">Prov 15:21</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Prov 12:23", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Prov 14:8", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ps 38:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 38, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Prov 14:18", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Prov 16:22", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 16, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Prov 27:22", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Prov 22:15", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 22, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Prov 14:1", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Prov 14:29", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Prov 15:21", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 21}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אִוֶּ֫לֶת", "אִוַּלְתִּי", "כְּסִילִים", "כֶּסֶל", "פְּתָאִים", "אֱוִלִיים", "׳", "א", "חַכְמוֺת נָשִׁים", "תְּבוּנָה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB195", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}